category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libjpeg-devel libtiff-devel
sdesc: "Library of DSP functions for telephony (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Spandsp is a library of many DSP functions for telephony. These range from
simple modules, such as DTMF detection, to a complete software FAX machine."
